  "contextReadyReason": "",
  "summary": "",
  "description": "Action-system consistency: (1) rename the pane-close actions to the `delete_` prefix matching `delete_column`/`delete_workspace`, and (2) separate action tooltip text from the action config name as an explicit `ActionDescriptor` property. All slices are behavior-preserving, gated by test suite + clippy clean. `SidebarDeleteSelected` is intentionally NOT renamed (keeps the Sidebar-context prefix).\n\nCode refs (verified 2026-07-09):\n- WmAction variants: `ClosePane` (input.rs:227), `ClosePaneById` (input.rs:264), `SidebarDeleteSelected` (input.rs:293).\n- action_from_name: `\"close\"` (input.rs:491), `\"close_pane_by_id\"` (input.rs:760), `\"sidebar_delete_selected\"` (input.rs:508).\n- [confirm] config key already `delete_pane` (config.default.toml:101) — must not be broken.\n- PaneAction::Close (appearance.rs:68), maps to `\"close\"` (chrome/mod.rs:452), default `[\"split\",\"close\"]` (appearance.rs:180/856).\n- ActionDescriptor fields: name/label/description/category/default_binding/icon (actions.rs:65-82) — no tooltip field yet.",
